sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Client as Client App (SPA/Mobile)
    participant Auth as Authorization Server

    Note over Client: Generate "code_verifier" (random string)<br/>Generate "code_challenge" (SHA-256 hash of verifier)

    %% Request 1
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Client->>Auth: GET /authorize<br/>(client_id, code_challenge, code_challenge_method=S256)
    end
    
    %% Request 2
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
    Auth->>User: Display Login Page
    User->>Auth: POST /login<br/>(Submit username & password)
    Auth-->>Client: Redirect to redirect_uri<br/>with Authorization Code (code)
    end
    
    %% Request 3
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Client->>Auth: POST /token<br/>(client_id, code, code_verifier)
    
    Note over Auth: 1. Validate authorization code<br/>2. Hash the "code_verifier"<br/>3. Compare result to saved "code_challenge"
    
    Auth-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>Returns JWT (Access Token / ID Token)
    end